Bind Npc 29070 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 29071 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 781 "[Crack of All Means] What's the problem?"
    Journal for karus "You must accept the request of [Order of the Sorcery] Gater."
    Journal for elmorad "You must accept the request of [Order of the Sorcery] Knocker."
    Collect 4 of 900318000
    Collect 1 of 900319000

Requires player level >= 51 and quest 780 is completed

Rewards
    Give 10000000 experience

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "New disease? Is it like the flu?? Let's hurry and go visit Gather. I don't want to go to the doctors."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "New disease? Is it like the flu?? Let's hurry and go take a visit to Noker. I don't want to go to the doctors."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "From the contaminated area, a new kind of disease is spreading. Currently it's spreading through pigs. But this might definitely effect human. Can you help us?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Sure. I'll move you to the contaminated area. Obtain [Contaminated Snake Scale] from [Contaminated Lamia] and [Contaminated Hard Snake Scales] from their chief [Contaminated Ramiros].\n\nCollect [Contaminated Snake Scales] and [Contaminated Hard Snake Scales] from the contaminated area which Gator is sending you."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "From the contaminated area, a new kind of disease is spreading. Currently it's spreading through pigs. But this might definitely effect human. Can you help us?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Sure. I'll move you to the contaminated area. Obtain [Contaminated Snake Scale] from [Contaminated Lamia] and [Contaminated Hard Snake Scales] from their chief [Contaminated Ramiros].\n\nCollect [Contaminated Snake Scales] and [Contaminated Hard Snake Scales] from the contaminated area which Noker is sending you."

On in_progress
    Say "What's the problem? I don't think you have enough."
    Topic "[Enter Dungeon]" do
        Enter instance 81 set 2 at 204 197

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "You have them all! We can start the experiment.\n\nHerga from Luferson Castle is looking for you, <selfname>. When you come she says deliver [Haoong Clan Warrior's Blood]."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "You have them all! We can start the experiment.\n\nNez from El Morad Castle is looking for you, <selfname>. When you come she says deliver [Haoong Clan Warrior's Blood]."

On completed
    If player is karus
        Say "Please come back when you level up to 52."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Please come back when you level up to be 52."
